  init-roles [--force]   create the project's role folders (.claude/factory/roles/<role>/README.md and reads.md)
  agent <name|N>         open Claude in that agent's own worktree (created the first time), for manual work there.
                         To run the queue, use loop -i instead (a fresh session per task). --detach: in a detached
